Client
  |
  v
FastAPI API
  - app/main.py
  - app/api/router.py
  - app/api/v1/process.py
  |
  v
Pipeline Layer
  - app/services/pipeline.py
  - normalizes text
  - enforces token limit
  - masks PII
  - retrieves RAG context
  - calls LLM classifier
  |
  +--> PII/Security
  |     - app/security/presidio.py
  |
  +--> RAG / Vector Search
  |     - app/services/rag/retriever.py
  |     - Qdrant
  |
  +--> LLM
  |     - app/services/llm/__init__.py
  |     - OpenAI or mock classifier
  |
  +--> Persistence
  |     - PostgreSQL / pgvector
  |     - app/db/session.py
  |
  +--> Async Worker, optional
        - Celery
        - Redis broker
        - app/tasks/process_document.py